        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-55577\"><b>Laurey 55577, 1-1/4 Diameter Cabinet Knob in Venetian Bronze</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/4 Diameter Knob Venetian Bronze is a simple, modern cabinet pull that will look good with almost any style kitchen. This Kitchen Cabinet Knob in Venetian Bronze comes packaged with the mounting hardware. It can be used on any lightweight drawer or door.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Venetian Bronze 1-1/4 Diameter Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish:Venetian Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-55577\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55577-SM.jpg?v=1704354520\" width=\"100\" height=\"67\" alt=\"LAU-55577\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/polished-chrome-1-1-4-diameter-cabinet-knob-laurey-55526\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55526-SM.jpg?v=1704354514\" width=\"100\" height=\"67\" alt=\"LAU-55526\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-1-1-4-diameter-cabinet-knob-laurey-55559\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55559-SM.jpg?v=1704354514\" width=\"100\" height=\"67\" alt=\"LAU-55559-SM.jpg\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-1-1-4-diameter-cabinet-knob-laurey-55566\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55566-SM.jpg?v=1704354520\" width=\"100\" height=\"67\" alt=\"LAU-55566-SM.jpg\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/antique-brass-1-1-4-diameter-cabinet-knob-laurey-55505\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-55505-SM.jpg